      "role": "user",
      "content": "Thanks. To make the brief more comprehensive, I want to look closer at the \"tensions\" you mentioned. Can you expand on what specifically might cause that friction? For instance, from a sociological perspective, what are the typical concerns regarding the disruption of long-standing social norms, local traditions, or the general sense of \"stability\" in a neighborhood when the demographic makeup shifts so significantly? I want to capture why some residents might feel that their community identity is being eroded.",
